277	    /**
278	     * Build the customer code '<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>': CITY3 is the upper-cased first three
279	     * letters of {@code city}, LAST3 the upper-cased first three letters of {@code lastName},
280	     * and NNNN a per-city 4-digit zero-padded sequence equal to one more than the number of
281	     * owners already registered in that city (e.g. 'SYD-SMI-0007').
